---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Writings from '../components/Writings.astro'
---

<Layout title="Software engineer | Bruno Arueira" full={true}>
  <h1 class="leading-tight m-auto mb-8 mt-6 md:w-2/4 w-full" style="transition: all 1s ease;">
    Hi, I'm <span>Bruno</span>.
  </h1>

  <p class="text-lg leading-loose m-auto md:w-2/4 w-full dark:text-white">
    I build reliable backend systems, cloud platforms, and developer tooling that help engineering teams move faster.
  </p>

  <p class="text-lg leading-loose m-auto md:w-2/4 w-full dark:text-white">
    With more than 16 years of experience, I help engineering teams design, build, and evolve production systems, working across APIs, cloud infrastructure, developer tooling, observability, and AI-assisted engineering workflows.
  </p>

  <p class="text-lg leading-loose m-auto md:w-2/4 w-full dark:text-white">
    I enjoy solving engineering problems that improve reliability, scalability, and developer productivity.
  </p>

  <Writings />
</Layout>
